      "revision_request": "Restate the H5 finding by explicitly comparing the same pickup_hour on both days (e.g., WHERE pickup_hour BETWEEN 12 AND 23 if restricting to afternoon/evening, or presenting hour-by-hour trips_per_hour for matching hours). Do not claim that total daily volumes differ 'due to day-of-week patterns' without isolating hour-level comparisons. Include a note that Tuesday and Wednesday are different weekdays, so a fair rain effect test requires same-hour pairing or a day-of-week covariate."
